# Environment profiles for this project
#
# 1. Copy templates:
#      cp .env.local.example .env.local
#      cp .env.production.example .env.production
#
# 2. Fill in your hosted Supabase URL/key in `.env.production`.
#
# 3. Run with the matching profile:
#      npm run android:dev   → .env.local  + starts local Supabase
#      npm run android:prod  → .env.production
#      npm start             → .env.local  (Expo dev server)
#      npm run start:prod    → .env.production
#
# Optional `.env` — shared secrets (Mapbox, Google) merged into both profiles.
#
# See `.env.local.example` and `.env.production.example` for all variables.
